[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to file upload handling, specifically an Unrestricted File Upload vulnerability. This vulnerability arises when the application allows users to upload files without adequately validating the file type or content. In this case, the application accepts video files through a multipart form-data request, but if there are no checks in place to ensure that the uploaded file is indeed a valid video format, an attacker could exploit this by uploading malicious files disguised as videos. This could lead to various security issues, including remote code execution or denial of service, as the application may process unexpected file types or content.

